<h2>What’s new</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Categories & Permissions stored in PluginSettings (UI + REST)</li>
  <li>Workflow respects permissions (field=assignee|reporter)</li>
  <li>JQL optional arg: category filter</li>
</ul>

<h2>Getting Started</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Manage apps → enable modules</li>
  <li>Open <code>/plugins/servlet/delegat1on/category</code> and add categories</li>
  <li>Open <code>/plugins/servlet/delegat1on/permissions</code> and toggle permissions</li>
  <li>Open <code>/plugins/servlet/delegat1on/configforadmin</code> to add delegations</li>
</ol>

<h2>Workflow</h2>
<p>Add <em>User is Delegate of</em> condition or <em>Assign to Delegate of</em> post-function. Option <code>field=assignee|reporter</code>.</p>

<h2>JQL</h2>
<pre>assignee in delegatesOf(currentUser(), "Vacation")
reporter in delegatorsOf("alice")</pre>

<h2>REST</h2>
<ul>
  <li>GET <code>/rest/delegat1on/1.0/records?active=1</code></li>
  <li>GET <code>/rest/delegat1on/1.0/categories</code>, POST/DELETE</li>
  <li>GET <code>/rest/delegat1on/1.0/perms</code>, PUT</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
